# Test: TestChanges_MultipleStatusCodes

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Sample API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    post:
      summary: Create user
      operationId: createUser
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                name:
                  type: string
                email:
                  type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: User updated
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                properties:
                  id:
                    type: integer
                  name:
                    type: string
                  email:
                    type: string
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Sample API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    post:
      summary: Create user
      operationId: createUser
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                name:
                  type: string
                email:
                  type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: User updated
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                properties:
                  id:
                    type: integer
                  name:
                    type: string
                  email:
                    type: string
        '201':
          description: User created
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                properties:
                  id:
                    type: integer
                  name:
                    type: string
                  email:
                    type: string
                  createdAt:
                    type: string
                    format: date-time
```

## Compact Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.createUser()`:  `response.status[201]` **Added** (Breaking ⚠️)

## Full Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.createUser()`:  `response.status[201]` **Added** (Breaking ⚠️)

